---
title: Pumpkin Pie
tags:
  - desserts
source:
  name: Serious Eats
  url: https://www.seriouseats.com/extra-smooth-pumpkin-pie-recipe
---

Prepare a blind-baked @./pie-dough{1}.

Preheat oven to 350°F.

Mix @cream cheese{8%ounces} and @pumpkin puree{15%ounces} in a #big mixing bowl{}.

Add @granulated sugar{3%ounces}, @kosher salt{0.5%tsp}, @ground cinnamon{1%tsp}, @ground ginger{1%tsp}, and @ground nutmeg{1%tsp}.

Add @melted butter{0.25%cup}(cooled) and @eggs{3}(large).

Mix well.

Pour into prepared pie crust, transfer to a #sheet pan{}, cover edges with aluminum foil, and bake ~{35%minutes}.

> Bake until the center few inches still looks a little wet and jiggles, baking until it "looks" done means it's overbaked and will crack in the middle once it cools.

Serve with @./whipped-cream{1}.